codex
I found the concrete environment defect: processes report namespace PID `2`, but `/proc` exposes the host PID; Lean 4.22 resolves its executable through `/proc/<getpid()>/exe`, so it receives `ENOENT`. `/proc/self/exe` is available. I’m applying a narrowly scoped compatibility shim for the rerun that redirects only `/proc/<digits>/exe` `readlink` calls to `/proc/self/exe`; it does not alter any audit input or generated source.
apply patch
